INSERT INTO `message` VALUES (1,1,3,NULL,'https://trophy-talk-4b6e8.web.app/post-details?postId=13','SHARE','2025-08-22 09:43:49','2025-08-22 09:43:49'),(2,2,2,1,'Hi jac','text','2025-08-28 10:58:37','2025-08-28 10:58:37'),(3,3,22,1,'Wassssuppp doggggh','text','2025-08-29 13:18:33','2025-08-29 13:18:33'),(4,4,17,1,'Here we go!','text','2025-08-29 14:30:09','2025-08-29 14:30:09'),(5,5,22,NULL,'A yoooooo big doggg','text','2025-08-29 16:36:54','2025-08-29 16:36:54'),(6,3,17,1,'Wasssssssssuuuuuupppppp mooooooonn n niiiieeeee','text','2025-08-29 21:31:26','2025-08-29 21:31:26'),(7,3,22,1,'😆','text','2025-08-29 21:32:23','2025-08-29 21:32:23'),(8,3,17,1,'Don’t go crazy on horse posts lol','text','2025-08-29 21:34:04','2025-08-29 21:34:04'),(9,3,17,1,'I want to get other people posting so settle down 😂😂😂','text','2025-08-29 21:34:24','2025-08-29 21:34:24'),(10,3,22,1,'Hehehehhe','text','2025-08-29 21:38:27','2025-08-29 21:38:27'),(11,6,17,1,'Cute goat!','text','2025-08-29 22:57:31','2025-08-29 22:57:31'),(12,6,45,1,'Make notification numbers red','text','2025-08-31 02:17:09','2025-08-31 02:17:09'),(13,6,17,1,'Done and done. Send me a video of your ranch so I can make you filthy rich','text','2025-08-31 02:19:32','2025-08-31 02:19:32'),(14,7,17,NULL,'Hi Pam,\n\nI wanted to take a moment to reach out and let you know how much we appreciate what you’ve built with Open Range Social. It’s always great to see passionate folks in the hunting community creating spaces that bring people together and celebrate our shared interests.\n\nWe’ve actually been working on Trophy Talk, for over a year and a half now, and I know firsthand how much work and dedication goes into building something from the ground up. There are plenty of challenges along the way, and I’d love to hear more about your journey—what’s been working well for you, and what hurdles you’ve faced?\n\nIf there’s anything we can do to support you or help Open Range Social grow, please don’t hesitate to let me know. At the end of the day, we’re all in this together, working to strengthen and support the hunting community.\n\nLooking forward to connecting!','text','2025-09-01 20:56:52','2025-09-01 20:56:52'),(15,9,17,NULL,'Welcome to the Trophy Talk Community! Looking forward to seeing your posts and hope you have a great hunting season!','text','2025-09-06 02:55:53','2025-09-06 02:55:53'),(16,10,18,NULL,'Hi','text','2025-09-09 14:19:06','2025-09-09 14:19:06'),(17,11,17,1,'Hey are you selling those trail cameras?','text','2025-09-16 21:00:42','2025-09-16 21:00:42'),(18,12,17,1,'Sup boys','text','2025-09-16 21:21:47','2025-09-16 21:21:47'),(19,12,25,1,'Sup','text','2025-09-16 22:05:45','2025-09-16 22:05:45'),(20,11,98,1,'I can hook you up with a discount code, they’re sold here in Wisconsin. I will eventually become a dealer, as of right now I’m helping promote the product, across all platforms. As well as the other brands I help! \nThese cameras are by far the best I’ve ever used. Lifetime warranty!','text','2025-09-17 01:59:04','2025-09-17 01:59:04'),(21,11,17,1,'Anyway you can help get them on our marketplace? Would buy a handful and get them on here at no cost','text','2025-09-17 02:09:19','2025-09-17 02:09:19'),(22,11,98,1,'How do we go about that? \nI’m also general manager for Vader Bows\n\nAnd sales for Outrigger Outdoors','text','2025-09-17 02:10:13','2025-09-17 02:10:13'),(23,11,17,1,'That’s awesome! On your profile you can sell products very easy. Just a simple application that we approve then list products. Go to profile -> settings -> apply to become seller','text','2025-09-17 02:12:28','2025-09-17 02:12:28'),(24,11,17,1,'If you wa to sell products for them or they can set up an account and start selling. Great thing about this platform as we grow it will be 100% target market for these items','text','2025-09-17 02:14:05','2025-09-17 02:14:05'),(25,11,98,1,'Alright, is there a way to see all the current products on the marketplace?','text','2025-09-17 02:14:08','2025-09-17 02:14:08'),(26,11,17,1,'Been live for two weeks working on getting some brands on board. You guys would be one of the first to join. That’s why I’d let you guys sell at no cost. As we grow sellers will have a 10-15% commission to the platform','text','2025-09-17 02:17:07','2025-09-17 02:17:07'),(27,11,17,1,'Cameras would be a great start. I’d buy 3-5 today','text','2025-09-17 02:18:04','2025-09-17 02:18:04'),(28,11,98,1,'What’s a good phone number to reach you at? And your name! \nMy names Aaron by the way. I’m thinking this could be a very big platform. \n\nI’d love to spread the word of it. I’d have to apply for my own EIN according to the application to sell the product. Being I’d sell all the products I have access to. ( Vader Bows, All the outrigger outdoor products, and of course yellowstone ai. \n\n\nI’m gonna speak to Ben (Owner) of Yellowstone in the AM. I’m sure he will be on board.  I can answer any questions you may have about the trail cameras! Or any of it, I run the bundle, which includes all of it! (Lithium packs, as card, solar panel, whole package deal. \n\n\nThe cameras are lifetime warranty, cover animal damage which (bears) Yukon….. could benefit you dearly! \nThey cover natural disaster as well. And theft protection!','text','2025-09-17 02:27:13','2025-09-17 02:27:13'),(29,11,17,1,'970-324-4668 Justin Donahoo\n\nYou can use your social instead of an EIN it’s just for a w9 that will be required to send if you sell over a certain $ amount.\n\nI appreciate it! We agree this could be a big app!!! We have some big updates coming that will include outfitter bookings, fractional ranch ownership opportunities and influencer programs to work with sellers and brands. \n\nI watched all the videos on Yellowstone cameras they look sweet and would be perfect for our spot as we have very little service.','text','2025-09-17 02:31:51','2025-09-17 02:31:51'),(30,2,2,1,'Hi jack again','text','2025-09-17 10:06:11','2025-09-17 10:06:11'),(31,2,2,1,'Hi jack how you','text','2025-09-17 10:06:39','2025-09-17 10:06:39'),(32,2,2,1,'??','text','2025-09-17 10:06:48','2025-09-17 10:06:48'),(33,2,2,1,'????','text','2025-09-17 10:06:59','2025-09-17 10:06:59'),(34,2,2,1,'Are you good','text','2025-09-17 10:07:14','2025-09-17 10:07:14'),(35,2,2,1,'?','text','2025-09-17 10:07:31','2025-09-17 10:07:31'),(36,2,2,1,'?','text','2025-09-17 10:07:42','2025-09-17 10:07:42'),(37,2,1,1,'Hi','text','2025-09-17 10:07:57','2025-09-17 10:07:57'),(38,2,2,1,'D','text','2025-09-17 10:10:58','2025-09-17 10:10:58'),(39,2,2,1,'A','text','2025-09-17 10:11:43','2025-09-17 10:11:43'),(40,2,2,1,'B','text','2025-09-17 10:12:09','2025-09-17 10:12:09'),(41,2,2,1,'E','text','2025-09-17 10:12:15','2025-09-17 10:12:15'),(42,2,2,1,'Q','text','2025-09-17 10:12:26','2025-09-17 10:12:26'),(43,2,1,1,'Yf','text','2025-09-17 10:12:52','2025-09-17 10:12:52'),(44,2,2,1,'Hi jack how are you','text','2025-09-17 10:13:41','2025-09-17 10:13:41'),(45,2,2,1,'Are you good','text','2025-09-17 10:14:01','2025-09-17 10:14:01'),(46,2,1,1,'Yes','text','2025-09-17 10:14:10','2025-09-17 10:14:10'),(47,2,2,1,'Okay','text','2025-09-17 10:14:20','2025-09-17 10:14:20'),(48,2,2,1,'Q','text','2025-09-17 10:14:43','2025-09-17 10:14:43'),(49,2,1,1,'Hxhd','text','2025-09-17 10:14:49','2025-09-17 10:14:49'),(50,2,2,1,'D','text','2025-09-17 10:14:59','2025-09-17 10:14:59'),(51,2,2,1,'E','text','2025-09-17 10:15:08','2025-09-17 10:15:08'),(52,2,2,1,'E','text','2025-09-17 10:15:13','2025-09-17 10:15:13'),(53,2,2,1,'Hi jack how are you','text','2025-09-17 10:16:08','2025-09-17 10:16:08'),(54,2,2,1,'?','text','2025-09-17 10:16:18','2025-09-17 10:16:18'),(55,2,1,1,'Okay','text','2025-09-17 10:16:27','2025-09-17 10:16:27'),(56,2,2,1,'Ok','text','2025-09-17 10:16:34','2025-09-17 10:16:34'),(57,2,2,1,'?','text','2025-09-17 10:16:43','2025-09-17 10:16:43'),(58,2,1,NULL,'Hi','text','2025-09-17 10:47:19','2025-09-17 10:47:19'),(59,2,1,NULL,'Hi','text','2025-09-17 10:47:32','2025-09-17 10:47:32'),(60,2,1,NULL,'