,000*          |\r\n| Estimated Mortgage (7%, 20yr)| ~$36,500/year**  |\r\n\r\n*Annual management and operating costs for a single owner  \r\n**Estimate only; actual payments may vary\r\n\r\nWhy Fractional Ownership?\r\n- Lower entry cost per owner\r\n- Shared annual expenses\r\n- Access to premium hunting land and amenities\r\n\r\nContact Trophy Talk for details or to reserve your share!\r\n\r\n','PUBLISHED','2025-11-06 22:22:01','2025-11-12 23:56:18',1,6.00,'37.34033840000001','-95.2610838'),(20,'Diverse Allen Kansas','4575 Arizona Rd, Savonburg, KS 66772, USA',33150.00,10,0,80.00,'Trophy Whitetail Deer,Turkey Hunting,Food Plots,Tillable Income',2000,'Diverse Allen County KS 80 Acres\r\n\r\nProperty Overview\r\nLocation: Allen County, KansasAcreage: 80 acres (more or less)Habitat: Diverse mix of heavy timber, tillable fields, ponds, and food plots  \r\nHighlights:\r\n600 lb feeder\r\n1 new Banks blind\r\n24 acres of tillable production ($80/acre/year income)\r\nHeavy timber and cover\r\n2 small ponds and multiple watering holes\r\nSecluded food plot with heavy wildlife traffic\r\nMature wildlife and excellent bedding areas\r\nMix of bean and corn fields for food\r\n1.5 hours from Kansas City & Wichita, 4.5 hours from Linn, MO\r\nTurnkey hunting and passive income potential\r\nThis property is a true SE Kansas honey hole—beautifully laid out, loaded with deer sign, and ready for immediate hunting and income.\r\n\r\nFractional Ownership Structure\r\nTotal Shares: 10\r\nPurchase Price: $330,000\r\nTransaction Fee (5%): $16,500\r\nManagement Fee: $2,000/share/year\r\nOperating Costs: $1,000/share/year\r\nClosing & Legal Fees: $500/share (one-time, included in initial share price)\r\n\r\nShare Price Calculation (Initial Raise)\r\nBase Share Price: $33,000 ($330,000 / 10 shares)\r\nTransaction Fee: $1,650/share ($16,500 / 10)\r\nClosing & Legal Fees: $500/share\r\nTotal Initial Share Price: $35,150/share\r\n\r\nAnnual Costs per Share:\r\nManagement Fee: $2,000\r\nOperat